==Russian==

===Alternative forms===
* {{l|ru|недѣ́ля}} {{ru-PRO}}

===Etymology===
From {{inh|ru|orv|недѣлꙗ||Sunday}}, equivalent to {{l|ru|не}} + {{m|ru|делать|де́лая|no working}}, originally used to mean [[Sunday]], the day of rest (Old Church Slavonic {{m|cu|недѣлꙗ|sc=Cyrs||not doing}}).

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|неде́ля}}
* {{audio|Ru-неделя.ogg|Audio|lang=ru}}

===Noun===
{{ru-noun+|неде́ля}}

# [[week]]
#:* {{lang|ru|в}} неде́лю — ''per week''
#:* {{lang|ru|на}} [[прошлый|про́шлой]] неделе — ''last week''
#: {{ru-ux|на [[этот|э́той]] неде́ле|this week|inline=y}}
#: {{ru-ux|на [[будущий|бу́дущей]] неде́ле|next week|inline=y}}
# {{label|ru|archaic}} [[Sunday]]

